/sup>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be shattered, broken</em>, fig. of nations under divine judgment <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.8\">Is 7:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.31\">30:31</a>; so prob. also <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.9\">Is 8:9</a><sup>(×3)</sup> (but del. in v a), and perhaps (of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s foes in gen.) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.10\">1 S 2:10</a> (song;—others render <em>dismayed</em> in all except <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.8\">Is 7:8</a>); fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s righteousness <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.6\">Is 51:6</a> (= be abolished, annihilated); lit. of bows <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:56\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.56\">Je 51:56</a>, according to Gie’s reading <span dir=\"rtl\">חַתָּה</span> v. <strong>Pi. </strong>"}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be dismayed</em>, usually"},{"senses":[{"definition":"abs.: | <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרֵא</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.21\">Dt 1:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:8\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.8\">31:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:1\" href=\"/Joshua.8.1\">Jos 8:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:25\" href=\"/Joshua.10.25\">10:25</a> (all D), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.11\">1 S 17:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.4\">Je 23:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.10\">30:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.27\">46:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 2:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.2.6\">Ez 2:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.9\">3:9</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.13\">1 Ch 22:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.20\">28:20</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.15\">2 Ch 20:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.17\">17</a>; 